When this issue was taken up on 11.07.2025, the Health Secretary was called upon to file an affidavit regarding the following aspects:
(i) Steps to be taken for online registration of the OPD patients in Sishu Bhawan,
Cuttack;
(ii) Availability of such online registration facility to be widely circulated in print and electronic media;
(iii) Display Boards to be placed in the hospitals at vantage points regarding availability of such facility for public awareness; and (iv) The website should indicate the names of Professors and Doctors who would be in charge of the OPD on a particular day.

